    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this high-stakes shooter, firepower alone won\u2019t be enough you need quick thinking too. At the start of each round, attacking players must answer general knowledge questions. Answer correctly, and you\u2019re safe. Get it wrong, and you\u2019ll suffer a deadly disadvantage your health will slowly drain, and your location will be revealed to everyone. The only way to remove the penalty? Reach key zones on the map. But be careful your enemies know where you\u2019re going and will be waiting to take you down. Will you fight through the chaos, outsmart your opponents, or risk it all to recover? Only the smartest and most skilled players will survive. There is a also a deathmatch mode for players to test their combat skills in a free-for-all battle.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this high-stakes shooter, firepower alone won\u2019t be enough you need quick thinking too. At the start of each round, attacking players must answer general knowledge questions. Answer correctly, and you\u2019re safe. Get it wrong, and you\u2019ll suffer a deadly disadvantage your health will slowly drain, and your location will be revealed to everyone. The only way to remove the penalty? Reach key zones on the map. But be careful your enemies know where you\u2019re going and will be waiting to take you down. Will you fight through the chaos, outsmart your opponents, or risk it all to recover? Only the smartest and most skilled players will survive. There is a also a deathmatch mode for players to test their combat skills in a free-for-all battle.</p>",
    "short_description": "This intense shooter combines combat with trivia, answering questions correctly keeps you safe, while wrong answers drain your health and reveal your location. To recover, you must reach risky map zones, but enemies will hunt you. Only the smartest and most skilled will survive.",
